# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the container)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# Secrets: never copy env files into images
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Logs and tooling
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea

# Docker files (not needed inside images)
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# Docs
**/*.md